    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104524" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τράλλεις</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τραλλεῖς</span></b> , οἱ,
		<u>Trallians</u> (from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τραλλία</span>
		in Illyria, <i><span class="en">
			Theopomp.Hist.
			340
		</span></i>), Thracian barbarians, sometimes employed as mercenaries, l. c.,
			<i><span class="en">
			D.S.
			17.65
		</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τραλλεεῖς</span> codd.), <i><span class="en">
			Plu.
			<u>Ages.</u>
			16
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>: —also called <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τράλλοι</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			St.Byz.
		</span></i>, and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τράλλιοι</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			Str.
			14.1.42
		</span></i> (om. codd. plerique). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τράλλεις</span></b> , αἱ, <i>Tralles,</i> a city in Caria, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				1.4.8
			</span></i>, etc.; also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τράλλις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιος</span>, ἡ, Epigr. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Agath.
				2.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Choerob.
				<u>in Theod.</u>
				1.196
			</span></i> H., etc.; gen. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τράλλεος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
					946
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Tralles</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				632.6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τράλλεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Choerob.
					<u>in Theod.</u>
					1.195
				</span></i>
			 H.:—<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τραλλιανός</span></b> , ὁ, <i>a Trallian,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				14.1.42
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Mith.</u>
				23
			</span></i>.</div>
